 "name_en": "Compliance Management with SAP Global Trade Services (24J)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Compliance Management with SAP Global Trade Services (24J)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioad154fd23b934795854344d4448fa2fd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad154fd23b934795854344d4448fa2fd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Customers can utilize existing rules in SAP Global Trade Services on-premise by integration with <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables the communication scenario and the appropriate RFC calls for synchronizing the relevant import and export documents. Successfully processing documents requires that the relevant customers and material masters already exist in the SAP Global Trade Services system.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad154fd23b934795854344d4448fa2fd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create applicable documents in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to trigger document transfer to SAP Global Trade Services</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad154fd23b934795854344d4448fa2fd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Fully integrate SAP Global Trade Services Compliance Management with <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Leverage an existing investment in SAP Global Trade Services 11.0 for a best-of-breed deployment of an international trade solution with minimal new configuration</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>通过 SAP Global Trade Services 的合规性管理 (24J)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioad154fd23b934795854344d4448fa2fd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad154fd23b934795854344d4448fa2fd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过与 SAP <span class=\"ph pname\">S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 集成，客户可以使用 SAP Global Trade Services（企业预置版）中的现有规则。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目启用通信场景和相应的 RFC 调用，以同步相关导入和导出凭证。成功处理凭证要求相关客户和物料主数据已存在于 SAP Global Trade Services 系统中。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad154fd23b934795854344d4448fa2fd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中创建适用的凭证，以触发到 SAP Global Trade Services 的凭证传输</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad154fd23b934795854344d4448fa2fd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">完全集成 SAP Global Trade Services Compliance Management 与 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">利用 SAP Global Trade Services 11.0 中的现有投资，以最少的新配置以最佳方式部署国际贸易解决方案</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
